          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " This quadrilateral is a parallelogram. In "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\Delta \\mathrm { A B C }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\Delta  ACD , AB = CD"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " B "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathsf { C } = \\mathrm { A D }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "AC = AC.\\; \\mathrm{SO}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " by SSS congruence "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\Delta  ABC  \\cong \\Delta  CDA"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Therefore "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle 1 = \\angle 4"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle 2 = \\angle 3"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.247,
            0.163,
            0.582,
            0.295
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 1,
              "bbox": [
                0.247,
                0.163,
                0.582,
                0.295
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_37_image_1.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.228,
            0.313,
            0.706,
            0.352
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle 1"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle 4"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " are the alternate angles of AB and CD. So "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { A B } { \\big \\| } \\mathrm { C D }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.227,
            0.353,
            0.725,
            0.392
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "And "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle 3"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle 2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " are the alternate angles of BC & AD So "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { B C } { \\big \\| } \\mathrm { A D } ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.227,
            0.393,
            0.71,
            0.433
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Thus both the pairs of opposite sides are parallel. Hence ABCD is a parallelogram."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.442,
            0.847,
            0.5
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. Will the sum of the angles in a quadrilateral such as the following one also be "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 6 0 ^ { \\circ } ?"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Find the answer using geometric reasoning as well as by constructing this figure and measuring."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.384,
            0.498,
            0.6,
            0.665
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.384,
                0.498,
                0.6,
                0.665
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_37_image_6.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.67,
            0.664,
            0.709
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Yes, the sum of angles in a quadrilateral ADCB is 360°."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.71,
            0.624,
            0.75
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Join BD, Now Sum of angles of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\Delta  ADB = 180^{\\circ}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " And sum of angles of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\Delta \\mathrm{BDC} = 180^{\\circ}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.662,
            0.619,
            0.844,
            0.774
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 9,
              "bbox": [
                0.662,
                0.619,
                0.844,
                0.774
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_37_image_9.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.75,
            0.663,
            0.772
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Adding both sums of angles of quadrilateral "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "= 3 6 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.779,
            0.845,
            0.818
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "11. State whether the following statements are true or false. Justify your answers."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.822,
            0.845,
            0.861
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) A quadrilateral whose diagonals are equal and bisect each other must be a square."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.864,
            0.845,
            0.886
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) A quadrilateral having three right angles must be a rectangle."
            }
          ]
        },
